---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Wellness Guides | Silken Valley Lifestyle"
  heroTitle="Wellness Guides"
  heroText="Helpful information and inspiration for fitness, nutrition, healthy habits, and everyday wellbeing."
  heroCompact={true}
>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Health, Fitness & Wellbeing</p>
    <h1>Wellness Guides & Everyday Wellbeing</h1>
    <p>
      Explore practical information and ideas to support an active,
      balanced lifestyle. Discover resources covering exercise,
      nutrition, rest, personal care, and the everyday habits that
      contribute to overall wellbeing.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="grid">
    <a class="card" href="#fitness-movement">
      <h3>Fitness & Movement</h3>
      <p>Exercise basics, physical activity, and staying active.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#running-walking">
      <h3>Running & Walking</h3>
      <p>Training ideas, walking routines, and running fundamentals.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#strength-conditioning">
      <h3>Strength & Conditioning</h3>
      <p>Strength exercises, conditioning, and general fitness principles.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#flexibility-mobility">
      <h3>Flexibility & Mobility</h3>
      <p>Stretching, mobility exercises, and comfortable movement.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#nutrition">
      <h3>Nutrition & Healthy Eating</h3>
      <p>Food groups, balanced meals, ingredients, and everyday nutrition.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#sleep-rest">
      <h3>Sleep & Rest</h3>
      <p>Restful routines, sleep habits, and the importance of recovery.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#stress-management">
      <h3>Stress Management</h3>
      <p>Relaxation, mindful activities, and creating calmer routines.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#daily-habits">
      <h3>Healthy Daily Habits</h3>
      <p>Simple routines that support an organized and balanced lifestyle.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#outdoor-activity">
      <h3>Outdoor Activity</h3>
      <p>Enjoying nature, fresh air, recreation, and outdoor exercise.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#personal-wellbeing">
      <h3>Personal Wellbeing</h3>
      <p>Personal care, balance, leisure, and making time for yourself.</p>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section id="fitness-movement" class="content-section">
    <h2>Fitness & Movement</h2>
    <p>
      Regular physical activity is an important part of an active
      lifestyle. Explore different forms of exercise, general fitness
      principles, and practical ways to incorporate movement into
      everyday routines.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/fitness/">Explore Fitness</a></p>
  </section>

  <section id="running-walking" class="content-section">
    <h2>Running & Walking</h2>
    <p>
      Walking and running are accessible ways to enjoy physical activity
      and spend time outdoors. Discover information about getting
      started, building consistent routines, selecting appropriate
      footwear, and developing a comfortable training schedule.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="strength-conditioning" class="content-section">
    <h2>Strength & Conditioning</h2>
    <p>
      Strength and conditioning activities can help develop muscular
      fitness, coordination, and general physical capacity. Learn about
      resistance exercises, basic training principles, rest periods,
      and the importance of appropriate technique.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="flexibility-mobility" class="content-section">
    <h2>Flexibility & Mobility</h2>
    <p>
      Flexibility and mobility exercises encourage comfortable movement
      and can complement many forms of physical activity. Explore
      stretching basics, gentle movement routines, and ways to include
      mobility work in a regular fitness schedule.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="nutrition" class="content-section">
    <h2>Nutrition & Healthy Eating</h2>
    <p>
      A varied and balanced approach to eating can make everyday meals
      both enjoyable and nourishing. Explore food groups, meal planning,
      ingredient information, cooking methods, and practical ideas
      for preparing balanced meals.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/recipes/">Explore Recipes</a></p>
  </section>

  <section id="sleep-rest" class="content-section">
    <h2>Sleep & Rest</h2>
    <p>
      Rest is an important part of everyday wellbeing. Discover ideas
      for establishing consistent evening routines, creating a
      comfortable sleeping environment, and making time for recovery
      between busy days and physical activities.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="stress-management" class="content-section">
    <h2>Stress Management</h2>
    <p>
      Everyday responsibilities can make it difficult to find time
      to slow down. Explore general relaxation techniques, mindful
      activities, outdoor experiences, and simple ways to create
      moments of calm throughout the day.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="daily-habits" class="content-section">
    <h2>Healthy Daily Habits</h2>
    <p>
      Small, consistent habits can help create structure and balance
      in everyday life. Consider practical routines involving
      movement, hydration, meal preparation, rest, and time spent
      enjoying personal interests.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="outdoor-activity" class="content-section">
    <h2>Outdoor Activity</h2>
    <p>
      Spending time outdoors offers opportunities for recreation,
      exploration, and physical activity. Discover ideas for walking,
      hiking, cycling, gardening, and enjoying the natural environment
      throughout the seasons.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/gardening/">Explore Gardening</a></p>
  </section>

  <section id="personal-wellbeing" class="content-section">
    <h2>Personal Wellbeing</h2>
    <p>
      Personal wellbeing includes making time for activities that
      bring enjoyment, relaxation, and a sense of balance. Explore
      personal care routines, hobbies, leisure activities, and
      practical ways to make space for yourself.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>Explore More</h2>
    <p>
      Continue discovering useful information and inspiration
      throughout Silken Valley Lifestyle.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/fitness/">Fitness</a> |
      <a href="/recipes/">Recipes</a> |
      <a href="/gardening/">Gardening</a> |
      <a href="/resources/">All Resources</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
